     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi All,<div><br></div><div>I&#39;m new to both the R environment and MSstats.  I wanted to try out the MSstats package on some label-free MQ data that I have.  I used the converter script from your website to convert the MQ data to input format compatible with MSstats.  However, when I try to parse the data and process it, I keep running into problems.  Any help advice would be greatly appreciated.</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div><br>Tharan</div><div><br></div><div>After running the attached R script for converting to MSstats input, I ran this command:</div><div><br></div><div><div>raw&lt;-read.csv(&quot;MS_input.csv&quot;)</div><div>head(raw)</div><div><br></div><div>#=====================</div><div># Function: dataProcess</div><div># pre-processing data: quality control of MS runs</div><div>? dataProcess</div><div>quantData&lt;-dataProcess(raw, fillIncompleteRows=TRUE)  </div><div>quantData[1:5,]</div></div><div><br></div><div>Since the MS_input file is to large to attach, here are the first few rows:</div><div><br></div><div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"704\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:528pt\">\r\n <colgroup><col width=\"64\" span=\"11\" style=\"width:48pt\">\r\n </colgroup><tbody><tr height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"19\" width=\"64\" style=\"height:14.4pt;width:48pt\"></td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">ProteinName</td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">PeptideSequence</td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">PrecursorCharge</td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">FragmentIon</td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">ProductCharge</td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">IsotopeLabelType</td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">Condition</td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">BioReplicate</td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">Run</td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">Intensity</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"19\" align=\"right\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">1</td>\r\n  <td>Q60675</td>\r\n  <td>EEAFTIHGTNLPVTR</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">3</td>\r\n  <td>NA</td>\r\n  <td>NA</td>\r\n  <td>L</td>\r\n  <td>A</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">1</td>\r\n  <td>140418_03_WT1-Basal_WCL</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">9602000</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"19\" align=\"right\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">2</td>\r\n  <td>Q99PL5</td>\r\n  <td>ESEEALQK</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">2</td>\r\n  <td>NA</td>\r\n  <td>NA</td>\r\n  <td>L</td>\r\n  <td>A</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">1</td>\r\n  <td>140418_03_WT1-Basal_WCL</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">3022200</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"19\" align=\"right\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">3</td>\r\n  <td>O35643</td>\r\n  <td>DCPLNTEAASNK</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">2</td>\r\n  <td>NA</td>\r\n  <td>NA</td>\r\n  <td>L</td>\r\n  <td>A</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">1</td>\r\n  <td>140418_03_WT1-Basal_WCL</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">3549800</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"19\" align=\"right\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">4</td>\r\n  <td>Q3TC33</td>\r\n  <td>EVGEALEER</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">2</td>\r\n  <td>NA</td>\r\n  <td>NA</td>\r\n  <td>L</td>\r\n  <td>A</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">1</td>\r\n  <td>140418_03_WT1-Basal_WCL</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">2780700</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"19\" align=\"right\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">5</td>\r\n  <td>P62900</td>\r\n  <td>LYTLVTYVPVTTFK</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">3</td>\r\n  <td>NA</td>\r\n  <td>NA</td>\r\n  <td>L</td>\r\n  <td>A</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">1</td>\r\n  <td>140418_03_WT1-Basal_WCL</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">18330000</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"19\" align=\"ri